  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Gu Immortal finds a six headed snake dead body and sells its parts and organs separately in treasure yellow heaven. The store lists skin, flesh, bones, eyes, and snake tendons, but no blood. The six headed snake is a desolate beast with strength comparable to rank six Gu Immortals; its whole body is a treasure and every part can be used in Gu refinement.",
