        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, the third item is an improved Medieval Antiquity Era Gu recipe set named inch of time, covering rank one to rank five with common refinement materials. The lowest price is twenty-two immortal essence stones, and bidders may also use the desolate beast six headed snake’s skin to reduce that price.",
